  "description": "The Major range from Stay Strong is their larger wheeled cruiser style bikes and they come in 3 size options, 24\", 26\" & 27.5\". Notable details include a Chromoly frame, Chromoly steerer tube, Fully sealed bearings throughout, lightweight Alloy stem & sprocket and full Chromoly 3pc cranks. All 3 are spec'd with the BMXer in mind with modern geometry applied so you'll be comfortable riding the Skatepark, The streets & trails or just commuting to and from work! ###section### Product Specs FRAME MATERIAL: Chromoly Top Tube & Down Tube WHEEL SIZE: 24\" TOP TUBE LENGTH: 21.75\" CHAIN STAY LENGTH: 14.75\" HEADTUBE ANGLE: 74.5° SEAT TUBE ANGLE: 70° FORKS: Chromoly Steerer Tube and Tapered Hi-Ten Legs BARS: - MATERIAL: Hi-Ten - TYPE: 2-Piece - RISE: 8\" Rise - WIDTH: STEM: Alloy Top Load HEADSET: Integrated BRAKE MOUNTS: Removable BRAKES: U-Brake FRONT HUB: 10mm Sealed FRONT RIM: Double Wall REAR HUB: 14mm Sealed Cassette REAR RIM: Double Wall TYRES: 2.3\" SPROCKET: 28t CRANKS: - MATERIAL: Chromoly - TYPE: 3-Piece - ARM LENGTH: 170mm BB: 19mm Mid PEDALS: Nylon/Fiberglass SEAT: Combo Seat/Post GEARING: 28/10 WEIGHT: 27.5lbs ###section### Product Highlights 24\" Wheels for that classic BMX cruiser feel Larger wheels allow for a more comfortable ride without sacrificing too much of that BMX feel Built strong and lightweight Includes sealed bearings A great all rounder, suitable for any type of riding ###shogun-image-section###",
